	(text "R5 = 10 kΩ gate-source pull-down\n\nPurpose:\nKeeps MOSFET OFF during startup/reset/floating input.\n\nCurrent when gate is high:\nI = VDRV/R = 12 V / 10 kΩ = 1.2 mA\n\nPower:\nP = V²/R = 12² / 10k = 14.4 mW\n\nEquivalent gate capacitance estimate:\nCgate,eq ≈ Qg/VGS = 236.7 nC / 10 V = 23.7 nF\n\nPassive discharge time constant:\nτ = R5 × Cgate,eq = 10k × 23.7 nF = 0.237 ms\n\n10 kΩ is strong enough to pull gate low but does not heavily load the driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.554 113.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1a8a17f2-0090-4c95-830b-4c52baf429c0")
	)
	(text "D1 = 15 V gate-source zener\n\nRequirement:\nVDRV < VZ < VGS(max)\n\nGiven:\nVDRV = 12 V\nVGS(max) = ±20 V\n\nChoose:\nVZ = 15 V\n\nNormal gate drive at 12 V will not clamp.\nIf gate overshoots, D1 clamps before VGS reaches 20 V.\nCathode/bar side to Q1_GATE.\nAnode to GNDPWR / MOSFET source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 46.99 157.988 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "258d8eec-33f2-4299-b904-2e41cfab5d27")
	)
	(text "C1 = 100 nF ceramic\nC2 = 1 µF ceramic\nBoth in parallel from VDRV to GNDPWR.\n\nMain sizing from gate charge:\nC ≥ Qg / ΔV\n\nAllow VDRV ripple ΔV = 0.25 V:\nC ≥ 236.7 nC / 0.25 V\nC ≥ 0.947 µF\n\nChoose C2 = 1 µF minimum.\nC1 = 100 nF handles high-frequency switching current.\nPlace C1 closest to U1 VDD/GND, C2 nearby."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "69ed8583-9d5a-486f-89d4-8556521bec35")
	)
	(text "D2 = 48 V bus TVS, value TBD\n\nSelection rules:\nVRWM > maximum normal battery voltage\nVC(clamp) < MOSFET VDS rating with margin\nTVS pulse power/energy > expected transient energy\n\nMOSFET VDS(max) = 80 V.\nNeed actual battery max voltage before final TVS selection.\nFor a nominal 48 V battery, fully charged voltage may be >48 V, \nso D2 cannot be chosen from nominal voltage alone."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 84.074 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8598a712-049b-4fbf-ba14-3e27b19ce64e")
	)
	(text "R3 = 10 Ω turn-on resistor\nR4 = 4.7 Ω turn-off resistor\n\nPeak gate current estimate:\nIgate ≈ VDRV / (Rext + Rdriver + Rg,int)\n\nTurn-on:\nIgate,on ≈ 12 V / (10 Ω + 0.85 Ω + 3.2 Ω)\nIgate,on ≈ 0.85 A < 4 A source limit\n\nTurn-off:\nIgate,off ≈ 12 V / (4.7 Ω + 0.35 Ω + 3.2 Ω)\nIgate,off ≈ 1.45 A < 8 A sink limit\n\nApprox gate charge time:\nt ≈ Qg / Igate\n\nt_on ≈ 236.7 nC / 0.85 A = 278 ns\nt_off ≈ 236.7 nC / 1.45 A = 163 ns\n\nR4 < R3 gives faster turn-off than turn-on.\nFinal values should be tuned by checking gate waveform/ringing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b13869b3-5748-4553-b62d-28d44b26c7bd")
	)
	(text "One Wheel Circuit Connection\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.29 59.436 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b21983a4-f52a-4ba5-a737-dd13e07ed76c")
	)
	(text "R1 = R2 = 33 kΩ\n\n1EDN differential input recommendation:\nFor 3.3 V controller signal, use Rin1 = Rin2 = 33 kΩ.\n\nInput current estimate:\nI = V/R = 3.3 V / 33 kΩ = 0.10 mA\n\nPower:\nP = V²/R = 3.3² / 33k = 0.33 mW\n\n33 kΩ is safe for STM32 GPIO and matches 1EDN input recommendation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 239.014 32.766 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b810f0aa-1394-4b9b-9b5c-d295686992d5")
	)
	(text "Component value assumptions:\nVDRV = 12 V gate-driver supply\nSTM32_ENABLE = 3.3 V logic\nMOSFET = MCTL1D0N08Y\nGate driver = 1EDN7550B\nMOSFET Qg = 236.7 nC, Rg,int = 3.2 Ω\nDriver source resistance ≈ 0.85 Ω, sink resistance ≈ 0.35 Ω\nMOSFET VGS(max) = ±20 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f8af6234-afaf-408a-ab24-1262c29f7e26")
	)
